#: imgallerydialog.cpp:51
msgid "Create Image Gallery"
msgstr "Creu Oriel Delweddau"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:58
msgid "Look"
msgstr "Gwedd"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:58
msgid "Page Look"
msgstr "Gwedd Dudalen"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:65
msgid "&Page title:"
msgstr "&Teitl y dudalen:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:68
#, c-format
msgid "Image Gallery for %1"
msgstr "Oriel Delweddau ar gyfer %1"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:74
msgid "I&mages per row:"
msgstr "&Delweddau bob rhes:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:80
msgid "Show image file &name"
msgstr "Dangos &enw'r ffeil delwedd"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:84
msgid "Show image file &size"
msgstr "Dangos &maint y ffeil delwedd"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:88
msgid "Show image &dimensions"
msgstr "Dangos &hyd a lled y ddelwedd"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:101
msgid "Fon&t name:"
msgstr "E&nw'r wynebfath:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:113
msgid "Font si&ze:"
msgstr "M&aint y wynebfath:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:125
msgid "&Foreground color:"
msgstr "Lliw'r &blaendir:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:137
msgid "&Background color:"
msgstr "Lliw'r &cefndir:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:147
msgid "Folders"
msgstr "Plygyll"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:153
msgid "&Save to:"
msgstr "Ca&dw i:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:156
msgid "<p>The name of the HTML file this gallery will be saved to."
msgstr "<p>Enw'r ffeil HTML cedwir yr oriel hon ynddo."

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:166
msgid "&Recurse subfolders"
msgstr "&Ymgylchu trwy'r is-blygyll"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:168
msgid ""
"<p>Whether subfolders should be included for the image gallery creation or "
"not."
msgstr "<p>A ddylid cynnwys is-blygyll ar gyfer creu'r oriel ddelweddau ai peidio."

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:174
msgid "Rec&ursion depth:"
msgstr "Dyfnder ym&gylchu:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:175
msgid "Endless"
msgstr "Di-ddiwedd"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:177
msgid ""
"<p>You can limit the number of folders the image gallery creator will "
"traverse to by setting an upper bound for the recursion depth."
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch gyfyngu ar nifer y plygyll bydd creawdydd yr oriel ddelweddau'n "
"mynd trostynt trwy osod cyfyngiad uchaf ar gyfer dyfnder yr ymgylchu."

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:189
msgid "Copy or&iginal files"
msgstr "Copïo'r &ffeiliau gwreiddiol"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:192
msgid ""
"<p>This makes a copy of all images and the gallery will refer to these "
"copies instead of the original images."
msgstr ""
"<p>Gwna hyn gopi o'r delweddau i gyd, a bydd yr oriel yn cyfeirio at y "
"copïau hyn yn lle'r delweddau gwreiddiol."

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:197
msgid "Use &comment file"
msgstr "Defnyddio ffeil &sylwadau"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:201
msgid ""
"<p>If you enable this option you can specify a comment file which will be "
"used for generating subtitles for the images."
"<p>For details about the file format please see the \"What's This?\" help "
"below."
msgstr ""
"<p>Os ydych yn galluogi'r dewisiad hwn cewch benodi ffeil sylwadau a "
"ddefnyddir i gynhyrchu is-deitlau ar gyfer y delweddau."
"<p>Am fanylion fformat y ffeil gweler cymorth \"Be' 'di Hyn?\" isod."

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:208
msgid "Comments &file:"
msgstr "Ffeil sy&lwadau:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:211
msgid ""
"<p>You can specify the name of the comment file here. The comment file "
"contains the subtitles for the images. The format of this file "
"is:"
"<p>FILENAME1:"
"<br>Description<br><br>FILENAME2:<br>Description<br><br>and so on"
msgstr ""
"<p>Cewch benodi enw'r ffeil sylwadau yma. Cynhwysa'r ffeil sylwadau'r "
"is-deitlau ar gyfer y delweddau.  Fformat y ffeil yma yw: "
"<p>ENWFFEIL1: "
"<br>Disgrifiad<br><br>ENWFFEIL2:<br>Disgrifiad<br><br>ac yn y blaen"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:238
msgid "Thumbnails"
msgstr "Rhagolygon cryno"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:252
msgid "Image format f&or the thumbnails:"
msgstr "Ff&ormat delwedd ar gyfer y rhagolygon cryno"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:260
msgid "Thumbnail size:"
msgstr "Maint y rhagolygon cryno:"

#: imgallerydialog.cpp:268
msgid "&Set different color depth:"
msgstr "Go&sod dyfnder lliw gwahanol"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:52
msgid "&Create Image Gallery..."
msgstr "&Creu Oriel Delweddau..."

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:61
msgid "Could not create the plugin, please report a bug."
msgstr "Methu creu'r ategyn, anfonwch adroddiad nam."

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:66
msgid "Creating an image gallery works only on local folders."
msgstr "Dim ond ar blygyll lleol y mae creu oriel delweddau'n gweithio."

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:84
msgid "Creating thumbnails"
msgstr "Creu rhagolygon cryno"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:105 imgalleryplugin.cpp:266
#, c-format
msgid "Couldn't create folder: %1"
msgstr "Methu creu plygell: %1"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:165
#, c-format
msgid "<i>Number of images</i>: %1"
msgstr "<i>Nifer y delweddau</i>: %1"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:166
#, c-format
msgid "<i>Created on</i>: %1"
msgstr "<i>Creuwyd ar</i>: %1"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:171
msgid "<i>Subfolders</i>:"
msgstr "<i>Is-blygyll</i>:"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:205
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Created thumbnail for: \n"
"%1"
msgstr ""
"Creuwyd rhagolwg cryno ar gyfer: \n"
" %1"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:208
msgid ""
"Creating thumbnail for: \n"
"%1\n"
" failed"
msgstr ""
"Methwyd creu rhagolwg cryno ar gyfer: \n"
" %1"

#: imgalleryplugin.cpp:223
msgid "KB"
msgstr "KB"

